# ADR Supersessions Log (append-only, immutable)
# Format: timestamp | from_adr → to_adr | reason | approver
# This log is the authoritative record of which ADRs have been superseded and by what.
# Every entry includes enough context to understand the reversal procedure.
# Entries are added by adr-supersede-check.mjs when an ADR status changes to Superseded.

